  },
  {
   "id": "sir-lovelot-132982@1.21",
   "gameId": "sir-lovelot-132982",
   "displayName": "Update 1.21",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-04-29T14:48:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you sooo much for the support you've given us since launch! Your valuable feedback has helped us understand what to fix, change or improve and make Sir Lovelot a better game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Time to list all the recent changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Managed to make controls for jumping even more snappy",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added triple checks to all achievements forcing them to unlock properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some leaderboards showing players with 0 playtime at the top of the list",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Certain effects and background elements are auto-disabled on slower hardware",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some tweaks to a few levels and colliders based on user feedback",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented fast reload buttons/keys mostly requested by speedrunners",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many minor fixes and overall performance optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mapped gamepad controls to more buttons...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "...which fittingly brings us to the next point. What’s left to do?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keyboard & gamepad remapping options. This is proving to be a headache as currently keyboard and gamepad inputs are not separate. This means that remapping the keyboard also overwrites the gamepad and vice-versa. But we’ll get there.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Display missing & hidden collectables in the current level (most likely on the pause screen vs. the HUD, not to spoil the fun for those who wish to go searching without help)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s about it. Thanks again everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Best wishes and have fun with Sir Lovelot!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
